      "Euro Ball Screen Offense — basic continuity",
      "Tuomas Iisalo / Bonn — early offense entries, drag and team reactions",
      "Mike Brown Early Flow — pace, spacing, quick decisions and early drag/drag-drag/quick"
    ]
  },
